{"id": "swebq0131", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.04, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1958, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Mathematician;Physicist;Philosopher;Astronomer;Scientist;Chemist", "query": "who was isaac newton and what did he do?", "transcript": "Who was Isaac Newton and what did he do?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Isaac Newton was a famous scientist. He lived a long time ago in England. He did many important things for science. One of his best-known discoveries was about gravity. He also worked on math, light, and how things move. Because of him, we know more about the world around us.", "answer_ms": 1338}
{"id": "swebq0134", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 3.95, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2385, "eot_read_ms": 21, "reference_answer": "Google Maps;Google Calendar;Google SketchUp;Google Docs and Spreadsheets;Blogger;Picasa;Google Talk;Google X;Gmail", "query": "what products and\\/or services does google offer customers?", "transcript": "What products and or services does Google offer customers?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Google offers a wide range of products and services designed to meet the needs of individuals, businesses, and developers. These include search engines like Google Search, which helps people find information online; productivity tools such as Gmail for email, Google Docs for document creation, and Google Drive for cloud storage; communication platforms like Google Meet and Google Chat for video calls and messaging; and Android, an operating system used by millions of smartphones worldwide. Additionally, Google provides advertising solutions through Google Ads, analytics via Google Analytics, and AI-driven technologies like Google Assistant and machine learning APIs that support innovation across industries.", "answer_ms": 2708}
