{"id": "swebq0140", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.74, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.2012, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Jesus Christ;Paul the Apostle;Saint Augustine of Hippo", "query": "what are the beliefs of the roman catholic?", "transcript": "What are the beliefs of the Roman Catholic?", "mode": "local", "answer": "The Roman Catholic faith centers on belief in one God, expressed through three persons—the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit. Followers believe in the authority of Sacred Scripture and Sacred Tradition, as interpreted by the Church. Key beliefs include the divinity of Jesus Christ, His life, death, and resurrection for the salvation of humanity, the real presence of Christ in the Eucharist, and the role of the sacraments, such as Baptism and Confession, in spiritual life. The Church teaches that grace, received through faith and good works, leads to eternal life with God. Central practices involve prayer, attending Mass, observing the Sabbath, and living according to moral teachings rooted in love of God and neighbor.", "answer_ms": 3330}
{"id": "swebq0143", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.55, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.3041, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince;Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows;Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire;Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone;Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets;Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix;Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban", "query": "what are the names of harry potter movies in order?", "transcript": "What are the names of Harry Potter movies in order?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Here are the Harry Potter movies in order of release date, from earliest to latest:\\n\\n1. Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone  \\n2. Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets  \\n3. Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban  \\n4. Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire  \\n5. Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix  \\n6. Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince  \\n7. Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows – Part 1  \\n8. Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows – Part 2", "answer_ms": 2871}
{"id": "swebq0146", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.37, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1906, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "The Invasion;Casino Royale;Munich;Enduring Love;Layer Cake;A Kid in King Arthur's Court;The Jacket;The Mother;Sylvia;Road to Perdition", "query": "what films has daniel craig been in?", "transcript": "What films has Daniel Craig been in?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Daniel Craig has appeared in several films, most notably as James Bond in the following movies from the 007 series, starting with \"Casino Royale\" in 2006. He played Bond again in \"Quantum of Solace\" in 2008, \"Skyfall\" in 2012, \"Spectre\" in 2015, and \"No Time to Die\" in 2021. Before his role as Bond, he was also seen in other notable films such as \"Layer Cake\" in 2004, \"The Jacket\" in 2005, \"Defiance\" in 2008, \"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo\" in 2011, and \"Logan Lucky\" in 2017.", "answer_ms": 3984}
{"id": "swebq0149", "pool": "swebq", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 2.27, "n_chunks": 3, "n_concurrent": 3, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1706, "eot_read_ms": 20, "reference_answer": "Abstract art;German Expressionism;Expressionism;Der Blaue Reiter", "query": "what kind of painter was wassily kandinsky?", "transcript": "What kind of painter was Wassily Kandinsky?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Wassily Kandinsky was a Russian painter known for being one of the pioneers of abstract art. He believed that colors and shapes could express emotions directly, without the need for realistic images. His work often included bold colors, geometric forms, and a sense of movement or spirituality. Kandinsky is considered a key figure in the development of abstract art and modern painting.", "answer_ms": 1679}
